/*
 * Declares the SyntaxCache, the syntax trees of the files a session already
 * read, kept for as long as their content does not change.
 *
 * A language server compiles the same package on every edit, most of its
 * modules (and all of the libraries it imports) unchanged since the previous
 * compilation; their trees are read again only when their content differs.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::syntax::visitor::cache
 * @File: ymirc/syntax/visitor/cache.yr
 * @Author(s):
